[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3395321080","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111561#issuecomment-3395321080","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111561","id":3395321080,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7KYHz4","user":{"login":"StarryWorm","id":41305715,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxMzA1NzE1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41305715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm","html_url":"https://github.com/StarryWorm","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-12T20:23:09Z","updated_at":"2025-10-12T20:53:50Z","body":"File include analysis:\r\n* `dictionary.cpp` 93 -> 93 (+0)\r\n* `type_info.h` 4 -> 70 (+66)\r\n* `variant_call.cpp` 94 -> 93 (-1)\r\n* `variant_construct.cpp` 94 -> 76 (-18)\r\n* `variant_destruct.cpp` 82 -> 72 (-10)\r\n* `variant.cpp` 106 -> 102 (-4)\r\n* `variant_op.cpp` 83 -> 75 (-8)\r\n* `variant_parser.cpp` 110 -> 110 (+0)\r\n* `variant_setget.cpp` 90 -> 90 (+0)\r\n* `variant_utility.cpp` 106 -> 97 (-9) \r\nTotal: -50 (excluding `type_info.h`), +16 (including `type_info.h`)\r\n\r\n`class_db.h` was included in all files excluding `type_info.h`. \r\nIt is no longer included in `variant_construct.cpp`, `variant_destruct.cpp`, `variant_op.cpp` (-3 includes).\r\nStill remains in:\r\n* `dictionary.cpp` through `container_type_validate.h` ... through `resource.h` and `refcounted.h`\r\n* `variant_call.cpp` through `marshalls.h` ... through `refcounted.h`\r\n* `variant_op.cpp` through `resource.h`\r\n* `variant_parser.cpp` through `resource.h` and `refcounted.h`\r\n* `variant_setget.cpp` through `resource.h` and `refcounted.h`\r\n* `variant_utility.cpp` through `resource.h` and `refcounted.h`","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3395321080/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3395444694","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111561#issuecomment-3395444694","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111561","id":3395444694,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7KYl_W","user":{"login":"StarryWorm","id":41305715,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxMzA1NzE1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41305715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm","html_url":"https://github.com/StarryWorm","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-12T22:59:03Z","updated_at":"2025-10-13T02:13:33Z","body":"#111567 is the first step towards finishing the delineation from `class_db.h` for the entirety of core/variant \r\n#111573 is the second step\r\n\r\nLooks like there will always be an issue with `container_type_validate.h` though, which also means `dictionary.cpp`","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3395444694/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3402110723","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111561#issuecomment-3402110723","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111561","id":3402110723,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7KyBcD","user":{"login":"StarryWorm","id":41305715,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxMzA1NzE1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41305715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm","html_url":"https://github.com/StarryWorm","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-14T14:16:26Z","updated_at":"2025-10-14T14:16:26Z","body":"I agree that these changes will likely have minimal (if any) performance benefits. The justification of \"delineating from `class_db.h`\" may thus be considered misguided.\r\nHowever, I would say these changes are still worth doing, since they clean up the headers for the `variant_` files, which are currently bloated. They were bloated due to `type_info.h` not having its required include, but since that gets fixed by this PR, I would argue that bundling together the bloat removal is the correct thing to do. \r\n\r\nLet me know if you would like me to split the PR into one that focuses solely on `type_info.h` and a second (if even) that focuses on the subsequential clean-up. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3402110723/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3402348081","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111561#issuecomment-3402348081","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111561","id":3402348081,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Ky7Yx","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-14T15:10:16Z","updated_at":"2025-10-14T15:15:32Z","body":"> I agree that these changes will likely have minimal (if any) performance benefits. The justification of \"delineating from `class_db.h`\" may thus be considered misguided. However, I would say these changes are still worth doing, since they clean up the headers for the `variant_` files, which are currently bloated. They were bloated due to `type_info.h` not having its required include, but since that gets fixed by this PR, I would argue that bundling together the bloat removal is the correct thing to do.\r\n> \r\n> Let me know if you would like me to split the PR into one that focuses solely on `type_info.h` and a second (if even) that focuses on the subsequential clean-up.\r\n\r\nI think we should merge the `type_info.h` changes, to avoid potential future build problems.\r\nBut the other changes to `variant_` files are not as relevant. I agree the includes are a bit messy, but every change we make to the codebase has some risk to cause regressions (e.g. break builds for modules), so we should have a good reason to merge the change. Since the `variant_` changes won't have an effect on build time, and won't bring us closer to isolating `ClassDB`, I don't think they qualify.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3402348081/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3402382151","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111561#issuecomment-3402382151","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111561","id":3402382151,"node_id":"IC_kwD